# C-Lite 主文法（实验五）
# 对应 PPT 附录 A：函数声明 + 入口调用、声明、控制流、表达式、关系表达式
# 形参用分号分隔（含末尾），实参用逗号；语句列表用分号分隔，最末语句不带分号
# 函数体后带分号，符合 1.src ~ 33.src 的样式
%start P
%terminals INT FLOAT_KW VOID IF ELSE WHILE RETURN PRINT INPUT
%terminals ID NUM FLOAT_LIT
%terminals ADD SUB MUL DIV LT LE EQ GT GE NE
%terminals ASG LPAR RPAR LBK RBK LBR RBR CMA SCO

P -> Decls

Decls -> Decls Decl | Decl

Decl -> FuncDef | VarDecl SCO | Call

VarDecl -> Type ID | Type ID LBK NUM RBK

Type -> INT | FLOAT_KW | VOID

FuncDef -> Type ID LPAR ParamList RPAR Body SCO | Type ID LPAR RPAR Body SCO

ParamList -> ParamList Param | Param

Param -> Type ID SCO | Type ID LBK RBK SCO

Body -> LBR StmtList RBR

StmtList -> Stmt | StmtList SCO Stmt

Stmt -> Matched | Unmatched

Matched -> IF LPAR B RPAR Matched ELSE Matched | OtherStmt

Unmatched -> IF LPAR B RPAR Stmt | IF LPAR B RPAR Matched ELSE Unmatched

OtherStmt -> VarDecl | Assign | WhileStmt | ReturnStmt | Call | PrintStmt | InputStmt | Block

Block -> LBR StmtList RBR

Assign -> ID ASG Expr | ID LBK Expr RBK ASG Expr

WhileStmt -> WHILE LPAR B RPAR Stmt

ReturnStmt -> RETURN | RETURN Expr

Call -> ID LPAR RPAR | ID LPAR ArgList RPAR

PrintStmt -> PRINT ID

InputStmt -> INPUT ID

ArgList -> ArgList CMA Expr | Expr

B -> Expr | Expr LT Expr | Expr LE Expr | Expr EQ Expr | Expr GT Expr | Expr GE Expr | Expr NE Expr

Expr -> Expr ADD Term | Expr SUB Term | Term

Term -> Term MUL Factor | Term DIV Factor | Factor

Factor -> NUM | FLOAT_LIT | ID | ID LPAR RPAR | ID LPAR ArgList RPAR | ID LBK Expr RBK | LPAR Expr RPAR
